// Bandit Level 13 → Level 14

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 13 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit13@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 12.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `sshkey.private` is present.

Step5: The private SSH key can be used to log in to the next level instead of using a password.

Step6: Set the correct permissions for the private key:

        chmod 600 sshkey.private

Step7: Use the private key to connect to the Bandit Level 14 server:

        ssh -i sshkey.private bandit14@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step8: The Bandit Level 13 → Level 14 challenge is solved.

Step9: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
